WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.166
In verse 13.30,

2
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.708
Lord Krishna clarifies

3
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:35.000
the distinction between the body and the soul.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.500
Here the body is called the kshetra

5
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.125
and the soul is called the kshetrajna.

6
00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:40.875
He says that all actions

7
00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.375
are done by material nature –

8
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.833
the soul remains only a witness.

9
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.458
This understanding is

10
00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:50.250
an important step in spiritual progress –

11
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.958
because through it humility comes to a person,

12
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:56.333
and they learn to remain inwardly

13
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.208
detached from material activities.

14
00:00:58.208 --> 00:00:58.833
When a person

15
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:02.208
realises that the soul is not the doer,

16
00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.708
they give up their false identification

17
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:11.291
with the body and mind, and
move toward true knowledge.

18
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.500
Lord Krishna explains

19
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.083
that the real doer of all actions

20
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.541
is Prakriti.

21
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:26.083
The body – made of the five great
elements, namely earth, water,

22
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:26.833
fire,

23
00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:31.000
air, and space, along with the
senses and the mind –

24
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.791
performs many actions,

25
00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:36.041
but the soul itself remains inactive.

26
00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:38.791
The soul is like a traveller,

27
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:40.125
who sits in a vehicle

28
00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:42.541
and watches the scenery of the journey,

29
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:45.208
but does not drive the vehicle himself.

30
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:47.333
This vehicle is the body,

31
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:51.083
which is driven by the laws of
Prakriti and karma.

32
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:54.208
One who truly sees this distinction

33
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:58.333
knows that walking, speaking, eating,

34
00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.750
even thinking –

35
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.583
all happen

36
00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.458
through the body and senses,

37
00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:06.333
which have arisen from Prakriti.

38
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:08.750
The soul, by its very nature, is pure

39
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.250
and separate from these –

40
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.375
it is only a witness.

41
00:02:12.375 --> 00:02:16.166
But because of its connection with
the body, the soul

42
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.583
comes to consider itself the doer.

43
00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:22.458
This can be understood through
the example of a machine.

44
00:02:22.458 --> 00:02:24.791
Just as a machine runs according to its design

45
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:26.958
and programme,

46
00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:29.583
in the same way the body too functions

47
00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:32.958
under the influence of past karma
and the three gunas

48
00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:36.000
of Prakriti – sattva, rajas, and tamas.

49
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.500
The soul is beyond this arrangement.

50
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.833
When this truth becomes clear,

51
00:02:40.833 --> 00:02:43.541
a person is able to observe the body’s actions

52
00:02:43.541 --> 00:02:46.291
without over-identifying with them.

53
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:49.375
This vision brings a great change in life.

54
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:51.583
When someone realises that the soul

55
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:53.875
does not take part in material actions,

56
00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:55.583
they become free from pride

57
00:02:55.583 --> 00:02:56.666
in success

58
00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:59.916
and guilt in failure.

59
00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:03.416
Just as the sun remains unaffected by clouds,

60
00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:04.958
in the same way the soul

61
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:08.250
remains unaffected by the actions of the body.

62
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.583
This understanding is not about
running away from responsibilities,

63
00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:15.000
nor about becoming indifferent.
Rather it means –

64
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.375
while remaining in worldly duties,

65
00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:18.791
not seeing oneself as

66
00:03:18.791 --> 00:03:23.208
over-identified with the body and its actions.

67
00:03:23.208 --> 00:03:24.125
This realisation

68
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:26.458
protects a person from ego

69
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.083
and false pride.

70
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:31.041
Such a person knows that material success

71
00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:33.250
or failure is not because of the

72
00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.041
actions done by them alone.

73
00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:36.791
This humility opens the path

74
00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:38.791
of spiritual progress,

75
00:03:38.791 --> 00:03:39.541
and gradually

76
00:03:39.541 --> 00:03:42.166
lifts them above the influence of Prakriti,

77
00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:43.583
leading them toward

78
00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:47.125
an eternal relationship with the Paramatma.

79
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:50.500
Lord Krishna concludes by saying –
‘sah pashyati’ –

80
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.458
meaning the one who sees this truth,

81
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:55.333
that the soul is not the doer,

82
00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:58.958
truly has real vision.

83
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:02.333
This true perspective is the beginning
of liberation –

84
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:06.125
because it breaks the bondage of karma

85
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:10.333
and opens the path to spiritual realisation.

86
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.333
You carry a great deal of weight

87
00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:19.666
in your life –

88
00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:21.791
the desire to achieve success,

89
00:04:21.791 --> 00:04:24.166
the fear of failing,

90
00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:27.500
pride when things work out,

91
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:32.000
and guilt when they go wrong.

92
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.791
But pause for a moment and consider –

93
00:04:36.791 --> 00:04:39.875
are you really doing all of this yourself?

94
00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:43.583
Actions are done by material nature –

95
00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.958
Prakriti.

96
00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:46.916
Your body,

97
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:50.750
mind, emotions – these are
all merely instruments.

98
00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.500
You – the soul –

99
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.750
are only a witness.

100
00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:01.583
Life is happening through you,

101
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:03.416
not by you.

102
00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:07.083
This does not mean you stop making effort

103
00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:08.666
or become indifferent.

104
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:13.500
Rather it means – not seeing yourself

105
00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.291
as over-identified with the body

106
00:05:15.291 --> 00:05:20.916
and its actions.

107
00:05:20.916 --> 00:05:25.125
You still make full effort,

108
00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:30.916
fulfil your responsibility, give your best –

109
00:05:30.916 --> 00:05:33.791
but you do not carry the burden of control.

110
00:05:33.791 --> 00:05:38.750
Then you begin to give in place of seeking!

111
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.916
The craving to receive is replaced

112
00:05:41.916 --> 00:05:45.041
by the spirit of offering.

113
00:05:45.041 --> 00:05:49.291
This vision brings real humility.

114
00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:52.125
You no longer think –

115
00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:55.500
‘I did this.’ And when events

116
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.291
do not go your way,

117
00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.750
you do not break either.

118
00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.000
You understand that your work

119
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.583
is to act with sincerity –

120
00:06:06.583 --> 00:06:09.166
not to take credit for the result.

121
00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:13.041
And through this awareness, life becomes
lighter, calmer,

122
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:16.000
and more meaningful.

123
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.416
Consider this and see.

124
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.875
You must have seen –

125
00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:26.000
in families, especially on children

126
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.958
or younger members,

127
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:32.416
there is often a pressure – to do everything right.

128
00:06:32.416 --> 00:06:36.041
The right marks, an excellent career,
an ideal marriage…

129
00:06:36.041 --> 00:06:39.291
And when things do not go according to plan,

130
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:43.375
there is guilt or blame –

131
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:47.375
‘Did I not guide them properly?’

132
00:06:47.375 --> 00:06:49.625
or ‘Why did they fail

133
00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:51.458
despite so much effort?’

134
00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:57.916
This verse reminds us of a liberating truth –

135
00:06:57.916 --> 00:06:59.708
it is Prakriti

136
00:06:59.708 --> 00:07:02.708
that drives all actions.

137
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:04.791
The body, the mind, and even

138
00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:08.000
the outcomes – are under forces

139
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:12.291
far greater than our control.

140
00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:17.083
You – the soul – are not the only doer.

141
00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:20.250
Your task is to act with sincerity –

142
00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.375
not to take on the entire burden.

143
00:07:23.375 --> 00:07:27.208
Teach this to your family not through sermons,

144
00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:30.583
but through your own conduct.

145
00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:33.958
Show them that the meaning of life is –

146
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:35.333
to fulfil your share

147
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:37.916
of responsibility with integrity,

148
00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:42.458
but not to get trapped in the
attachment to control.

149
00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:46.500
Because failure is not always personal,

150
00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:51.000
and success is not always in our hands.

151
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:55.916
When your family begins to value effort

152
00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:59.375
over perfection, learning over results,

153
00:07:59.375 --> 00:08:03.000
and sincerity over stress –

154
00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:07.250
then you create a calm atmosphere.

155
00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:11.083
And in such an atmosphere, not
only successful people,

156
00:08:11.083 --> 00:08:12.458
but steady,

157
00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:15.291
happy, and emotionally

158
00:08:15.291 --> 00:08:18.125
healthy souls are prepared.

159
00:08:22.958 --> 00:08:24.625
At the workplace

160
00:08:24.625 --> 00:08:29.291
we are taught to accept our responsibility –

161
00:08:29.291 --> 00:08:33.375
and yes, responsibility is important too.

162
00:08:33.375 --> 00:08:37.833
But when this sense of responsibility
becomes excessive –

163
00:08:37.833 --> 00:08:41.208
when we begin to think,

164
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:45.250
‘Everything depends on me’ –

165
00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.500
then we unknowingly push ourselves
toward stress,

166
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.416
ego, and exhaustion.

167
00:08:52.416 --> 00:08:57.375
We must understand that the real doer is Prakriti.

168
00:08:57.375 --> 00:08:58.791
Your body, mind,

169
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:00.041
and circumstances

170
00:09:00.041 --> 00:09:02.708
are driven by forces

171
00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:05.958
far greater than you.

172
00:09:05.958 --> 00:09:09.208
You – the soul – are here

173
00:09:09.208 --> 00:09:11.916
to be a witness, to give guidance,

174
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:15.833
and to contribute with sincerity –

175
00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:19.250
not to carry the full burden of every result.

176
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.000
This message is not about becoming careless,

177
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.875
but about caring in the right way.

178
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:29.375
Give your best.

179
00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:31.958
Lead with integrity.

180
00:09:31.958 --> 00:09:35.125
Make decisions with courage –

181
00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:37.666
but do not hold the illusion

182
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:42.416
that everything is in your control.

183
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:46.541
When you remember this, success

184
00:09:46.541 --> 00:09:48.125
feels light,

185
00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:51.791
and failure cannot break you.

186
00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:55.000
Freedom lies in this truth –

187
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.166
you are

188
00:09:56.166 --> 00:10:00.125
an important part of the process,

189
00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:03.125
but not the entire arrangement.

190
00:10:03.125 --> 00:10:07.166
When you move from ‘I am doing everything’

191
00:10:07.166 --> 00:10:11.083
to ‘I am a small part

192
00:10:11.083 --> 00:10:12.833
of God’s larger plan,

193
00:10:12.833 --> 00:10:16.458
and I am giving my best within it’ –

194
00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:19.416
move toward this.

195
00:10:19.416 --> 00:10:23.083
Then you lead with more calm, more confidence,

196
00:10:23.083 --> 00:10:26.375
and clearer vision.
